## 效能影響最小化

### 選擇性啟用策略
```python
# ✅ 效能最佳化策略
class PerformanceOptimizedDualDev:
    """效能最佳化的雙開發者模式"""
    
    def __init__(self):
        self.quick_validation_cache = {}
        self.common_patterns_cache = {}
    
    async def optimized_validation(self, proposal: SolutionProposal) -> ValidationResult:
        """最佳化的驗證流程"""
        
        # 快速預檢
        quick_check = self._quick_validation(proposal)
        if quick_check.is_obviously_valid:
            return ValidationResult(is_valid=True, fast_track=True)
        
        # 使用快取的常見模式
        pattern_match = self._match_common_patterns(proposal)
        if pattern_match.found:
            return self._apply_cached_validation(pattern_match)
        
        # 完整驗證
        return await self._full_validation(proposal)
```

